{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026BT5AMM1b5A1795561201.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>原油期貨價格從三個月低位反彈，但有分析認為油價仍面對下行壓力。</p><p></p><p>紐約期油收市報82.05美元一桶，升1.88美元，升幅百分之2.3。倫敦期油收市報91.4美元一桶，升2.03美元，升幅近百分之2.3。</p><p></p><p>瑞銀認為，油價正面對兩方面的溫和下行壓力，一來市場正消化部分中東近期的地緣政治風險，而戰略儲備的釋放，則令供應相對充裕，即使區域出口下降，以及中國需求強勁。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T23:44:21.921474+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T22:53:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T18:37:34.116721+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T23:37:37.634246+00:00","content_hash":"f9f622dded54a1644bd29b4fdf6cbbe109b95a3c02ab38fd36cfb288adefb0c3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T23:44:21.921474+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}